###

### Obtener cards del usuario

GET {{baseUrl}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Obtener cards públicas del usuario

GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/public

###

### Obtener card por ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Crear card

POST {{baseUrl}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logo_url": "https://vuejs.org/logo.png",
  "title": "Vue Docs",
  "description": "Documentación Vue en inglés",
  "documentation_url": "https://vuejs.org",
  "is_public": 1,
  "tags": ["vue","frontend"]
}

###

### Actualizar card

PUT {{baseUrl}}/cards/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logo_url": "https://vuejs.org/logo.png",
  "title": "Documentacion Vue",
  "description": "Documentación Vue 3 Inglés",
  "documentation_url": "https://vuejs.org",
  "is_public": 1,
  "tags": ["vue","frontend"]
}

###

### Eliminar card

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cards/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Obtener etiquetas de cards

GET {{baseUrl}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Crear etiquetas de cards

POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "vue"
}

###

### Obtener perfil del usuario logueado

GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

